rando: Hey Fia! You finally made it!
Ophelia (Funeral-Speak): Rias! It’s been so long, how have you been?
rando: Not bad! Sit down, the lobster is great here.
Ophelia (Funeral-Awkward): You already got something to eat?
rando: Well… yeah. You were an hour late…
Ophelia (Funeral-Awkward): I know, I know, I was just with Urseline. It took me a while to convince her to let me go with you…
rando: You know that you’re the one who’s meant to decide that, right
Ophelia (Funeral-Speak): Yea… But i dont want to disappoint her, that's all.
rando: But its YOUR life, why would she be happy if you didn't get to do what you want?
Ophelia: What is this really about, Rias?
rando: Fia, I’m saying this as your best friend. I haven’t seen you in 3 whole months. We’ve had to reschedule our meetups at least [b] Ten [/b]times now. Its always, “Urseline needed comfort”, or “Urseline didn’t want to be alone”. Do you know how that makes me feel? It makes me feel like you don't truly care about me. Its all about your “Everything”. Does that make me nothing then? It’s not healthy, Ophelia. Putting that much on one person is bound in one of you breaking at one point or another. When that happens, I’ll be waiting for you…
Ophelia (Funeral-Angry): You clearly don't know anything at all! You spew all this stuff as if you’ve ever even BEEN in a relationship. This is MY life, I know what is and isn’t healthy, so maybe you should stay out of where you don’t belong…
rando: It was nice seeing you again Fia...
